        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odd Dorable is a game created from my 4-year-old daughter’s drawings.</strong><br><br>Embark on a short, playful adventure through this cozy and welcoming open world filled with <strong>different puzzles to solve</strong>. Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>help the princess</strong> find all her lost candies. Rediscover your inner child as the game evokes a sense of wonder and curiosity. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.poster.avif?t=1776106243\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.webm?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.mp4?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏰ Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☁️ Step into a world of pure imagination, lovingly crafted together with my daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ Explore different playful locations and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤪 Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 Find all six magic candies and help the princess reclaim her magical powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.poster.avif?t=1776106243\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.webm?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.mp4?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game uses visual storytelling, so no language is needed to play and fully enjoy the experience.</strong></i><br><br>⚠️ <strong>Attention:</strong> This game is digestible 😋🍴<br><br>A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn’t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a short session without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odd Dorable is a game created from my 4-year-old daughter’s drawings.</strong><br><br>Embark on a short, playful adventure through this cozy and welcoming open world filled with <strong>different puzzles to solve</strong>. Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>help the princess</strong> find all her lost candies. Rediscover your inner child as the game evokes a sense of wonder and curiosity. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.poster.avif?t=1776106243\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.webm?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.mp4?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏰ Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☁️ Step into a world of pure imagination, lovingly crafted together with my daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ Explore different playful locations and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤪 Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 Find all six magic candies and help the princess reclaim her magical powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.poster.avif?t=1776106243\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.webm?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.mp4?t=1776106243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game uses visual storytelling, so no language is needed to play and fully enjoy the experience.</strong></i><br><br>⚠️ <strong>Attention:</strong> This game is digestible 😋🍴<br><br>A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn’t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a short session without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</p>",
